{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"329afde8265154f1","type":"group","x":-1280,"y":-320,"width":7280,"height":4560,"color":"#80b8f4","label":"解析逻辑"},
		{"id":"aa77b322d378f1f6","type":"group","x":-240,"y":464,"width":5440,"height":3216,"color":"5","label":"核心解析步骤"},
		{"id":"46b15f01a191dfc3","type":"group","x":776,"y":830,"width":4024,"height":2530,"label":"构造特征库"},
		{"id":"42c293d2496fd5aa","type":"group","x":1948,"y":2240,"width":1680,"height":601,"color":"5","label":"步骤2"},
		{"id":"82c13cd4d8030efa","type":"group","x":-40,"y":-209,"width":694,"height":300,"color":"5","label":"代码文件解析"},
		{"id":"84bef9681bf6a892","type":"group","x":343,"y":-960,"width":1257,"height":162,"color":"6","label":"上传到存储"},
		{"id":"48ca092dd6b629cb","type":"group","x":1180,"y":-201,"width":725,"height":142,"color":"#e1adda","label":"文件夹解析"},
		{"id":"1ce70d4fa738d122","type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"defined_elements\": [\n    {\n      \"file_path\": \"user/login.py\",\n      \"element_type\": \"function\",\n      \"element_name\": \"login\",\n      \"params\": [\"username\", \"password\"],\n      \"return_value\": \"token/错误码\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"internal_calls\": [],\n  \"cross_deps\": [\n    {\n      \"called_element\": \"encrypt\",\n      \"inferred_file_path\": \"common/utils.py\",\n      \"import_statement\": \"from common.utils import encrypt\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"logic_branches\": [\"校验入参是否为空→调用encrypt→生成token返回\"]\n}\n```","x":1683,"y":879,"width":680,"height":520,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"af530b9ff8633753","type":"text","text":"结果存入对应的表中","x":1780,"y":-160,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#e1adda"},
		{"id":"0c73ee87abeba8d2","type":"text","text":"文件分析后的完整数据内容：id,project_id,target_file_id\n,module_analysis,dependency_analysis,create_time.","x":1887,"y":147,"width":250,"height":188,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"156d4ec2881458eb","type":"text","text":"用户选定文件夹进行解析，根据这个文件的路径去分析文件之间关系","x":1260,"y":-181,"width":250,"height":102,"color":"#e1adda"},
		{"id":"13ec3d22248bb1db","type":"text","text":"fileInfo表中包括：id，projectid，filename，filepath，filetype，parentid","x":1330,"y":-940,"width":250,"height":122,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"9db0e586065d2d16","type":"text","text":"将所有文件的与元数据存放到数据表fileInfo中","x":990,"y":-909,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"1dbb124ab8513147","type":"text","text":"调用一次大模型","x":990,"y":199,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#64a1f2"},
		{"id":"520464adc16d31ce","type":"text","text":"统一特征结果的结构化格式：确保分片结果都是标准化JSON","x":281,"y":784,"width":280,"height":66,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e47c80b8a5261fb3","type":"text","text":"解压并读取所有文件","x":642,"y":-909,"width":217,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"cbf5b59912209ecb","type":"text","text":"把多个分片的结构化特征结果，按唯一标识去重+跨分片关联补全整合形成一份无重复有关联，结构化的全局特征库","x":671,"y":477,"width":250,"height":166,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ef1c8ffa0c2c07bc","type":"text","text":"#### 步骤 1：初始化全局特征库的 “容器\n表格\n\n| 容器名称                    | 作用                 | 唯一标识规则            |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------ | ----------------- |\n| `global_defined`        | 存储所有已定义的函数 / 类（去重） | `文件路径:元素类型:元素名`   |\n| `global_cross_calls`    | 存储所有跨文件调用关系（关联补全）  | `调用方元素ID→被调用方元素名` |\n| `global_logic_branches` | 存储所有逻辑分支（按文件整合）    | `文件路径`            |","x":780,"y":920,"width":444,"height":440,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"979fa1d9c6d38fbd","type":"text","text":"直接写入JSON","x":740,"y":59,"width":250,"height":52,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"7d942e7f162a84dc","type":"text","text":"上传文件/项目压缩包","x":363,"y":-911,"width":207,"height":64,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"7b84738817e6ebf7","type":"text","text":"用户选定代码文件进行解析","x":-20,"y":-189,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"9aba058369bfab7d","type":"text","text":"分片处理","x":-20,"y":139,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"4e06a19425c7725e","type":"text","text":"第一次 API 调用：单分片特征提取","x":-20,"y":530,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"978c03bd5d47dea6","type":"text","text":"#### 步骤 4：生成标准化的全局特征库 JSON\n```json\n{\n  \"module_key\": \"logic_code\",\n  \"project_id\": \"43a8afbf-14d5-4a3c-8f3d-581429a1e53f\",\n  \"global_defined_elements\": [\n    {\n      \"file_path\": \"user/login.py\",\n      \"file_id\": \"02300b86-aa27-4d9e-82ec-ff030a47475c\",  # 来自fileInfo表\n      \"element_type\": \"function\",\n      \"element_name\": \"login\",\n      \"params\": [\"username\", \"password\"],\n      \"return_value\": \"token/错误码\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file_path\": \"common/utils.py\",\n      \"file_id\": \"02e41fbc-69b1-4987-8525-4b6e8706a10f\",  # 来自fileInfo表\n      \"element_type\": \"function\",\n      \"element_name\": \"encrypt\",\n      \"params\": [\"pwd\"],\n      \"return_value\": \"加密后的字符串\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"global_cross_calls\": [\n    {\n      \"caller\": \"user/login.py:function:login\",\n      \"called\": \"common/utils.py:function:encrypt\",\n      \"call_status\": \"已匹配\",\n      \"import_statement\": \"from common.utils import encrypt\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"global_logic_branches\": {\n    \"user/login.py\": [\"校验入参是否为空→调用encrypt→生成token返回\"],\n    \"common/utils.py\": [\"接收密码→调用md5→返回加密结果\"]\n  }\n}\n```","x":295,"y":1642,"width":820,"height":900},
		{"id":"56c37c1ce0958eb4","type":"text","text":"- 输入：分片特征中的`cross_deps`（如`called_element=encrypt`，`inferred_file_path=common/utils.py`）；\n- 操作：\n    1. 生成被调用元素的**候选唯一标识**：`common/utils.py:function:encrypt`；\n    2. 去`global_defined`（已存储的所有定义元素）中查找是否有这个标识；\n    3. 匹配成功 → 标记`call_status=已匹配`，并记录被调用元素的完整信息（入参、返回值）；\n    4. 匹配失败 → 进入第二层验证。","x":2544,"y":979,"width":616,"height":320,"color":"#7ddce8"},
		{"id":"4dcc30fb29e21166","type":"text","text":"#### 第二层：基于`fileInfo`表验证文件是否存在\n\n- 输入：未匹配的`inferred_file_path=common/utils.py` + 目标`project_id`；\n- 操作：\n    1. 后端查询`fileInfo`表：`SELECT * FROM fileInfo WHERE project_id='xxx' AND file_path LIKE '%common/utils.py%'`；\n    2. 查询结果非空 → 说明文件存在，但 AI 没提取到`encrypt()`函数（可能函数在该文件的其他分片里）→ 标记`call_status=文件存在但未找到函数`；\n    3. 查询结果为空 → 说明文件不存在 → 标记`call_status=文件不存在`。","x":3340,"y":934,"width":465,"height":411,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1c15380fe1b3ab46","type":"text","text":"### logic_edge\n\n|                |                                 |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| id             | 边 ID                            |\n| project_id     | 关联项目 ID                         |\n| source_node_id | 调用方节点 ID                        |\n| target_node_id | 被调用方节点 ID                       |\n| call_type      | `direct`（直接调用）/`indirect`（间接调用） |\n| description    | 调用场景描述（如`login()调用encrypt()`）   |","x":-845,"y":1019,"width":452,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b48c90c615b5cc68","type":"text","text":"## 后端合并特征 → 构建全局特征库","x":1433,"y":1642,"width":250,"height":97,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"6a516422295051a2","type":"text","text":"####  第三层：跨分片检索未匹配的函数\n\n- 输入：`call_status=文件存在但未找到函数` + `fileInfo`表中`common/utils.py`的`file_id`；\n- 操作：\n    1. 后端找到`common/utils.py`对应的所有分片（比如`shard_02`/`shard_03`）；\n    2. 重新遍历这些分片的`defined_elements`，查找是否有`element_name=encrypt`的元素；\n    3. 找到 → 补充到`global_defined`，并更新`call_status=已匹配`；\n    4. 未找到 → 标记`call_status=文件存在但函数不存在`（可能是代码写错了，比如调用了不存在的函数）。","x":4160,"y":956,"width":488,"height":367,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"e3070be5b5dc2e05","type":"text","text":"**示例处理后`global_defined`**\n```python\n{\n  \"user/login.py:function:login\": {\n    \"file_path\": \"user/login.py\",\n    \"element_type\": \"function\",\n    \"element_name\": \"login\",\n    \"params\": [\"username\", \"password\"],\n    \"return_value\": \"token/错误码\"\n  },\n  \"common/utils.py:function:encrypt\": {\n    \"file_path\": \"common/utils.py\",\n    \"element_type\": \"function\",\n    \"element_name\": \"encrypt\",\n    \"params\": [\"pwd\"],\n    \"return_value\": \"加密后的字符串\"\n  }\n}\n```","x":1968,"y":2261,"width":563,"height":561},
		{"id":"42c8f1a55f7ff3c5","type":"text","text":"**示例处理后`global_cross_calls`**：\n\n\n```python\n[\n  {\n    \"caller\": \"user/login.py:function:login\",  # 调用方唯一标识\n    \"called\": \"common/utils.py:function:encrypt\",  # 被调用方唯一标识\n    \"call_status\": \"已匹配\",\n    \"import_statement\": \"from common.utils import encrypt\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"caller\": \"common/utils.py:function:encrypt\",\n    \"called\": \"内置模块:function:md5\",\n    \"call_status\": \"未匹配\",\n    \"import_statement\": \"\"\n  }\n]\n```","x":2613,"y":2311,"width":487,"height":460},
		{"id":"9ed83c3b100fc260","type":"text","text":"**示例处理后`global_logic_branches`**：\n\npython\n\n运行\n\n```python\n{\n  \"user/login.py\": [\"校验入参是否为空→调用encrypt→生成token返回\"],\n  \"common/utils.py\": [\"接收密码→调用md5→返回加密结果\"]\n}\n```","x":3219,"y":2359,"width":409,"height":364},
		{"id":"34515aa289ee4b6c","type":"text","text":"## 第二次 API 调用：拼接完整逻辑链","x":-120,"y":2135,"width":250,"height":127,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ccede673a050dcaa","type":"text","text":"## logic_node表\n\n|   |   |\n|---|---|\n|id|节点 ID|\n|project_id|关联项目 ID|\n|file_id|关联文件 ID（可选，节点属于某文件时）|\n|node_name|节点名称（如`login()`/`user/login.py`）|\n|node_type|`function`/`file`/`module`|\n|description|节点功能描述（来自 AI 分析）|","x":-845,"y":2182,"width":423,"height":360,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c78e1c600c5279b2","type":"text","text":"#### 步骤 3：结合`fileInfo`表补全关联（关键）\n\n利用`fileInfo`表的元数据，进一步验证 / 补全跨文件调用的路径：\n\n1. 对`call_status=\"未匹配\"`的调用关系（如`encrypt`），后端查询`fileInfo`表：\n    - 条件：`project_id=目标项目ID` + `file_path`包含`utils.py`；\n    - 若找到`common/utils.py`的记录，确认文件存在，标记`call_status=\"文件存在但未找到函数\"`；\n    - 若未找到，标记`call_status=\"文件不存在\"`；\n2. 对`call_status=\"已匹配\"`的调用关系，补全`fileInfo`表中的`file_id`（关联数据库主键），方便后续存储到`logic_edge`表。","x":1059,"y":2960,"width":999,"height":249,"color":"5"}
	],
